{"id":12209,"date":"2024-08-19T09:55:02","date_gmt":"2024-08-19T09:55:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12209"},"modified":"2024-08-19T09:55:02","modified_gmt":"2024-08-19T09:55:02","slug":"pribeh-spolecnosti-nicolet-a-vibracni-spektroskopie","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/pribeh-spolecnosti-nicolet-a-vibracni-spektroskopie\/","title":{"rendered":"P\u0159\u00edb\u011bh spole\u010dnosti Nicolet a vibra\u010dn\u00ed spektroskopie"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>V roce 1634 se francouzsk\u00fd dobrodruh a obchodn\u00edk <a href=\"https:\/\/www.historymuseum.ca\/virtual-museum-of-new-france\/the-explorers\/jean-nicollet-1634\/\"><strong>Jean Nicollet (Nicolet), Sieur de Belleborne<\/strong><\/a> stal prvn\u00edm Evropanem, kter\u00fd vstoupil na \u00fazem\u00ed, je\u017e je nyn\u00ed jedn\u00edm z pades\u00e1ti unijn\u00edch st\u00e1t\u016f USA: Wisconsin. Jean Nicollet byl p\u016fvodn\u011b vysl\u00e1n do oblasti Velk\u00fdch jezer Huron a Michigan, aby v\u00a0z\u00e1jmu plynulosti obchod\u016f s\u00a0ko\u017ee\u0161inami sjednal m\u00edr s m\u00edstn\u00edm indi\u00e1nsk\u00fdm kmenem Ho-Chunk. D\u00edky dokonal\u00e9 pam\u011bti, nad\u00e1n\u00ed pro studium jazyk\u016f a jezuitsk\u00e9mu vzd\u011bl\u00e1n\u00ed p\u016fsobil toti\u017e velmi \u010dasto jako m\u00edrov\u00fd vyjednava\u010d mezi r\u016fzn\u00fdmi indi\u00e1nsk\u00fdmi kmeny. Nicollet \u017eil n\u011bkolik let s\u00a0indi\u00e1ny v\u00a0man\u017eelsk\u00e9m svazku s\u00a0domorodou d\u00edvkou, ze\u00a0kter\u00e9ho si odvezl dceru Euphrasine-Madeleine Nicollet. Dobrodruh, cestovatel a mu\u017e, kter\u00fd jako prvn\u00ed b\u011bloch pronikl nejd\u00e1le do t\u011bchto nejvzd\u00e1len\u011bj\u0161\u00edch oblast\u00ed pln\u00fdch velk\u00fdch jezer a vodn\u00edch tok\u016f ov\u0161em neum\u011bl dob\u0159e plavat. Utonul p\u0159i plavb\u011b ve vod\u00e1ch u Qu\u00e9becu v \u0159\u00edjnu 1642. 29. \u0159\u00edjna se potom konal poh\u0159eb jeho a dal\u0161\u00edch t\u0159\u00ed mu\u017e\u016f, kte\u0159\u00ed se plavili s n\u00edm. Jejich t\u011bla nebyla nikdy nalezena.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12212\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12212\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12212\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/10a46d33-300x192.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"319\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/10a46d33-300x192.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/10a46d33-1024x654.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/10a46d33-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/10a46d33.jpg 1386w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12212\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">P\u0159ist\u00e1n\u00ed Jeana Nicolleta v Red Banks v roce 1634<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>O 329 let pozd\u011bji byla v\u00a0roce 1971 v\u00a0Madisonu, hlavn\u00edm m\u011bst\u011b Wisconsinu, zalo\u017eena spole\u010dnost <strong>Nicolet Instrument Corporation<\/strong>. Spole\u010dnost zalo\u017eil a vybudoval Robert Schumann, rod\u00e1k z\u00a0Madisonu, pomoc\u00ed pen\u011bz z\u00edskan\u00fdch z\u00a0\u00fasp\u011bchu firem vyr\u00e1b\u011bj\u00edc\u00edch multikan\u00e1lov\u00e9 analyz\u00e1tory MCA (Nuclear Data, Fabritek). P\u016fvodn\u011b mal\u00e1 spole\u010dnost pojmenovan\u00e1 na po\u010dest d\u00e1vn\u00e9ho neohro\u017een\u00e9ho dobrodruha se rychle rozrostla a produkc\u00ed \u0161pi\u010dkov\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f pro vibra\u010dn\u00ed spektroskopii proslavila jm\u00e9no Nicolet po cel\u00e9m sv\u011bte.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12216\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12216\" style=\"width: 550px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12216\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/af9c1e6c-1-300x110.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"550\" height=\"201\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/af9c1e6c-1-300x110.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/af9c1e6c-1-768x281.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/af9c1e6c-1.png 868w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 550px) 100vw, 550px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12216\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Hlavn\u00ed budova spole\u010dnosti Nicolet, Madison (1971)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>U\u017e v roce 1977 spole\u010dnost p\u0159edstavila sv\u016fj \u00fapln\u011b prvn\u00ed infra\u010derven\u00fd spektrometr s Fourierovou transformac\u00ed (FT-IR), <strong>Nicolet 7199<\/strong>. Hlavn\u00edm pou\u017eit\u00fdm materi\u00e1lem byly d\u0159evot\u0159\u00edska a sv\u011btle modr\u00fd umakart a velikostn\u011b zab\u00edral celou standardn\u00ed laborato\u0159. S\u00a0t\u00edmto technologicky p\u0159evratn\u00fdm p\u0159\u00edstrojem za\u010dala \u00e9ra dominance spole\u010dnosti Nicolet v oblasti vibra\u010dn\u00ed spektroskopie. <strong>Nicolet 7199<\/strong> byl u\u017e v\u00a0roce 1977 schopen <strong>spektr\u00e1ln\u00edho rozli\u0161en\u00ed 0,06 cm<sup>-1<\/sup><\/strong> a m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed v\u00a0rozsahu <strong>25 000 \u2013 10 cm<sup>-1<\/sup><\/strong>.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12218\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12218\" style=\"width: 555px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12218\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/7433938b-300x174.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"555\" height=\"323\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/7433938b-300x174.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/08\/7433938b.png 769w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 555px) 100vw, 555px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12218\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">FT-IR spektrometr Nicolet 7199 (rok 1977)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Aplikace vibra\u010dn\u00ed spektroskopie se b\u011bhem n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00edho desetilet\u00ed roz\u0161\u00ed\u0159ily a Nicolet pokra\u010doval v inovaci a roz\u0161i\u0159ov\u00e1n\u00ed sv\u00e9ho portfolia. Kdy\u017e v 80. letech 20. stolet\u00ed v\u011bdec <strong>Karl H. Norris<\/strong> z USDA (ministerstvo zem\u011bd\u011blstv\u00ed USA) za\u010dal intenzivn\u011b propagovat pou\u017eit\u00ed bl\u00edzk\u00e9 IR (NIR) spektroskopie k hodnocen\u00ed kvality zem\u011bd\u011blsk\u00fdch produkt\u016f, spole\u010dnost Nicolet m\u011bla dobrou pozici, aby poskytla p\u0159\u00edstrojov\u00e9 vybaven\u00ed pr\u00e1v\u011b potravin\u00e1\u0159sk\u00fdm v\u011bdc\u016fm. V n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00edch letech byly tak\u00e9 vyvinuty aplikace NIR spektroskopie v chemick\u00e9m, polymern\u00edm a ropn\u00e9m pr\u016fmyslu. N\u00e1sledoval farmaceutick\u00fd pr\u016fmysl, biomedic\u00ednsk\u00e9 v\u011bdy a anal\u00fdza \u017eivotn\u00edho prost\u0159ed\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p>V 80. letech 20. stolet\u00ed, se spektr\u00e1ln\u00ed anal\u00fdza v\u00fdrazn\u011b zjednodu\u0161ila d\u00edky nov\u00e9 technologii: osobn\u00edmu po\u010d\u00edta\u010di. Technici spole\u010dnosti Nicolet dok\u00e1zali napsat program pro stoln\u00ed po\u010d\u00edta\u010de propojen\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edmo s dan\u00fdm spektrometrem a pojmenovali tento software <strong>OMNIC<\/strong>. Ten byl schopen prov\u00e1d\u011bt specializovan\u00e9 a do t\u00e9 doby nesm\u00edrn\u011b u\u017eivatelsky n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e9 operace, jako je nap\u0159\u00edklad vyhled\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed specifick\u00fdch p\u00edk\u016f v\u00a0nam\u011b\u0159en\u00fdch FT-IR a FT-NIR spektrech, funkce, kter\u00e1 je dnes u\u017e naprostou samoz\u0159ejmost\u00ed pro jakoukoli spektr\u00e1ln\u00ed anal\u00fdzu.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1395\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1395\" style=\"width: 468px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1395 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/49c3947d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"468\" height=\"405\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/49c3947d.jpg 468w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/49c3947d-300x260.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 468px) 100vw, 468px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1395\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">FT-IR spektrometr Nicolet SUMMIT (rok 2024): modern\u00ed p\u0159\u00edstroj o velikosti b\u011b\u017en\u00e9ho k\u00e1vovaru<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.thermofisher.com\/blog\/materials\/applications-of-vibrational-spectroscopy\">V \u010dervenci 1992 spole\u010dnost <strong>Thermo Instrument Systems<\/strong>, p\u0159edch\u016fdce Thermo Fisher Scientific, koupila Nicolet Instrument Corporation<\/a>. To spojilo inovace a vysoce specializovan\u00e9 odborn\u00e9 znalosti t\u00fdmu ze spole\u010dnosti Nicolet s odborn\u00edky na produktivitu a celosv\u011btov\u00fd prodej z\u00a0firmy Thermo Instrument Systems. Kombinace zku\u0161enost\u00ed a produktivity znamenala, \u017ee Thermo Electron, jak byla nov\u011b slou\u010den\u00e1 spole\u010dnost pojmenov\u00e1na, se rychle stala \u0161iroce zn\u00e1m\u00fdm a d\u016fv\u011bryhodn\u00fdm jm\u00e9nem ve vibra\u010dn\u00ed spektroskopii. Thermo Electron pozd\u011bji op\u011bt expandoval a spojil se s firmou Fisher Scientific v kv\u011btnu 2006. Vznikla spole\u010dnost Thermo Fisher Scientific. Ta mohla v\u011bnovat je\u0161t\u011b v\u00edce zdroj\u016f na poskytov\u00e1n\u00ed integrovan\u00fdch, komplexn\u00edch technick\u00fdch \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed a nejmodern\u011bj\u0161\u00ed p\u0159\u00edstrojov\u00e9 techniky, v\u010detn\u011b nov\u00fdch inovac\u00ed v \u0159ad\u011b FT-IR spektrometr\u016f Nicolet a kompletn\u00ed nov\u00e9 \u0159ad\u011b Ramanov\u00fdch spektrometr\u016f a mikroskop\u016f.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>V roce 1634 se francouzsk\u00fd dobrodruh a obchodn\u00edk Jean Nicollet (Nicolet), Sieur de Belleborne stal prvn\u00edm Evropanem, kter\u00fd vstoupil na \u00fazem\u00ed, je\u017e je nyn\u00ed jedn\u00edm z pades\u00e1ti unijn\u00edch st\u00e1t\u016f USA: Wisconsin. Jean Nicollet byl p\u016fvodn\u011b vysl\u00e1n do oblasti Velk\u00fdch jezer Huron a Michigan, aby v\u00a0z\u00e1jmu plynulosti obchod\u016f s\u00a0ko\u017ee\u0161inami sjednal m\u00edr s m\u00edstn\u00edm indi\u00e1nsk\u00fdm kmenem Ho-Chunk. [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":12210,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[128,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-12209","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-128","category-novinky"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>P\u0159\u00edb\u011bh spole\u010dnosti Nicolet a vibra\u010dn\u00ed spektroskopie - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/pribeh-spolecnosti-nicolet-a-vibracni-spektroskopie\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"cs_CZ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"P\u0159\u00edb\u011bh spole\u010dnosti Nicolet a vibra\u010dn\u00ed spektroskopie - Nicolet CZ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"V roce 1634 se francouzsk\u00fd dobrodruh a obchodn\u00edk Jean Nicollet (Nicolet), Sieur de Belleborne stal prvn\u00edm Evropanem, kter\u00fd vstoupil na \u00fazem\u00ed, je\u017e je nyn\u00ed jedn\u00edm z pades\u00e1ti unijn\u00edch st\u00e1t\u016f USA: Wisconsin. Jean Nicollet byl p\u016fvodn\u011b vysl\u00e1n do oblasti Velk\u00fdch jezer Huron a Michigan, aby v\u00a0z\u00e1jmu plynulosti obchod\u016f s\u00a0ko\u017ee\u0161inami sjednal m\u00edr s m\u00edstn\u00edm indi\